      "content": "a small act of surrender... that sounds almost peaceful, in a dark way. but everything i do just feels like more of the same. i feel like i'm just taking up space that could be used for something else. if the only way to stop the pressure is to let it give way, doesn't that mean eventually everything just collapses anyway? like, why bother fighting to keep the structure standing if the end result is just to be broken?",
